8. Data Management and Persistence

8.1 Time‑Series Data

· All sensor readings, actuator commands, and world model states are stored in a distributed time‑series database (InfluxDB Enterprise) running on Storage Nodes.
· Retention policy:
  · Raw high‑rate (≥100 Hz): 30 days.
  · Aggregated (1 Hz): 1 year.
  · Critical events: indefinite.

8.2 Ethical Audit Log

· Every decision submitted to the Triad, along with the verdict and explanation, is written to an immutable ledger implemented with a permissioned blockchain (Hyperledger Fabric).
· Logs are hashed and anchored to Earth‑based systems for independent verification.

8.3 Configuration Management

· All system configurations (reactor setpoints, fusion model weights, scheduler policies) are versioned in etcd.
· Changes are authorised by the Triad and applied atomically across the ring.

